<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97454" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στωμ-ύλος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Luc.
			<u>Musc.Enc.</u>
			10
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>Im.</u>
			15
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόμα</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wordy, talkative</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				429
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Erx.</u>
				397d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				5.79
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ς. ταῦτα</span> this
				<i>nonsense,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.39
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Music.
			</span></i>): in good sense, <i>fluent, suave</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. εὐτυχίη</span>, of Menander, ib.<i><span class="en">
				187
			</span></i>; =
			<i>lepidus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>: c.inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμιλῆσαι
			ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Im.</u>
				15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαλῆσαι ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.65
			</span></i>: so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχουσι τι ς</span>. have a
				<i>gossipy</i> flavour, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				151
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στώμ-λως</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.161
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ωτέρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyd.
					<u>Mag.</u>
					3.73
				</span></i>
			.</div>
